    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Sindh Minister for Education and Literacy Dr Hamida Khuhro has lauded the role of Aga Khan University-Institute for Education Development in the implementation of educational reforms in Sindh and has said that the public sector had substantially benefited from AKU-IED's programmes for improving the quality of education in the province. She was addressing the graduation ceremony for the AKU-IED's Advanced Diploma Programmes on Saturday, January 21, 2006 at AKU Auditorium in Karachi.",
